p><tt>Dear e-Yantrik,</tt></p>

<p><tt>Greetings from Team e-Yantra!</tt></p>

<p><tt>Since you have been a part of one of our previous <strong>e-Yantra i=
nitiatives</strong> we are excited to invite you to the <strong>13th editio=
n of the e-Yantra Innovation Challenge (eYIC 2026&ndash;27)</strong>.</tt><=
/p>

<p><tt>Registrations are now open, and we would love to have you back!</tt>=
</p>

<h3><tt><strong>This year, you choose the problem.</strong></tt></h3>

<p><tt>Participate in one of two independent tracks:</tt></p>

<ul>
=09<li><tt><strong>Agriculture:</strong> Solve real-world challenges in far=
ming, food production, and agricultural technology.</tt></li>
=09<li><tt><strong>Sustainability:</strong> Build innovative solutions for =
a cleaner, greener, and more resilient future.</tt></li>
</ul>

<p><tt>Over the course of <strong>six months</strong>, your team will take =
a real problem from <strong>idea &rarr; prototype &rarr; pitch</strong>, wh=
ile learning design thinking, technology stacks, customer discovery, commun=
ication, and entrepreneurship.</tt></p>

<h3><tt><strong>Who can participate?</strong></tt></h3>

<p><tt>If you&rsquo;ve already completed your graduation, share this email =
with your college-going friends, juniors, and family members who may be int=
erested in participating.</tt></p>

<p><tt>Use the referral code <strong>EARLY26</strong> to get an <strong>add=
itional 10% discount</strong>, on top of the <strong>20% Early Bird discoun=
t</strong>, on the registration fee.</tt></p>

<p><tt>Form a team of 2&ndash;4 members. Reconnect with your previous teamm=
ates, or team up with juniors and friends who are ready to innovate!</tt></=
p>

<h3><tt><strong>Important Dates</strong></tt></h3>

<ul>
=09<li><tt><strong>Registration Deadline:</strong> <strong>25 September 202=
6, 11:59 PM</strong></tt></li>
=09<li><tt><strong>Early Bird Discount (20%):</strong> Valid till <strong>1=
1 September 2026, 11:59 PM</strong></tt></li>
</ul>

<h3><tt><strong>Register Now</strong></tt></h3>

<p><tt>Watch the Launch film:<a href=3D"https://youtu.be/XC9XzXkMoMo?utm_so=
urce=3Demail&amp;utm_medium=3Dreferral&amp;utm_campaign=3Deyic2627_referral=
"> https://youtu.be/XC9XzXkMoMo</a></tt></p>

<p><tt>Registration Portal :<a href=3D"https://eyic.e-yantra.org/team/regis=
ter?utm_source=3Demail&amp;utm_medium=3Dreferral"> https://eyic.e-yantra.or=
g/</a></tt></p>

<p><tt>For any queries, write to <strong>eyic@e-yantra.org</strong> or call=
 <strong>022-2576 4986 / +91 8097014114</strong>.</tt></p>

<p><tt>We look forward to seeing you innovate with us once again!</tt></p>

<p><tt>Warm regards,</tt></p>

<p><tt><strong>Team e-Yantra</strong><br />
CSE Department, IIT Bombay<br />
<a href=3D"http://www.e-yantra.org/">www.e-yantra.org</a></tt></p>
